From: Bogdan Mircea <mirceapetrebogdan@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] WPS: commit generated and file-owned PSKs before success

A registrar must not release credentials or report success while the configured
PSK owner has rejected publication. Append through the checked file owner,
retain its inode lock through synchronization and rollback, and publish the
runtime key only after acceptance. Commit file-owned keys before credential
construction and propagate callback failure through the native registrar.

Upstream-Status: Pending
Signed-off-by: Bogdan Mircea <mirceapetrebogdan@gmail.com>
---

